{"4033430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Peephole: Hotel Harborview", "steam_appid": 4033430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Your Office</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a simple job application at the Harborview Hotel quickly twisted into something far darker. Your “manager” isn’t human. He’s a demon. Now you’re trapped in a suffocating office, forced to work as a receptionist. Disobedience isn’t an option. Survival depends on compliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.poster.avif?t=1775132044\" width=672 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.webm?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.mp4?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Job Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Harborview Hotel draws in guests from every walk of life. Through your peephole, documents, and phone calls, you must uncover the truth—who’s Normal, and who’s Abnormal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.poster.avif?t=1775132044\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.webm?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.mp4?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Guests</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guests at Harborview Hotel are a peculiar bunch. It won’t be easy to tell what’s simply a harmless quirk and what’s a sign of something sinister. The demon is watching, so observe carefully. Failure could be fatal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.poster.avif?t=1775132044\" width=672 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.webm?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.mp4?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Judgment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make is judged. The demon holds a trial after each one, and all you can do is wait, hoping your judgment isn’t your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.poster.avif?t=1775132044\" width=672 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.webm?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.mp4?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Peephole is a linear psychological horror game that offers a good 60-120 minutes of unique immersive experience inspired by Papers, Please.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Your Office</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What began as a simple job application at the Harborview Hotel quickly twisted into something far darker. Your “manager” isn’t human. He’s a demon. Now you’re trapped in a suffocating office, forced to work as a receptionist. Disobedience isn’t an option. Survival depends on compliance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.poster.avif?t=1775132044\" width=672 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.webm?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3baa9516be1b3bdb38db55fab3877ff4.mp4?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Job Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Harborview Hotel draws in guests from every walk of life. Through your peephole, documents, and phone calls, you must uncover the truth—who’s Normal, and who’s Abnormal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.poster.avif?t=1775132044\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.webm?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/3bacedc2876426ecd2b8566095bbbe80.mp4?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Guests</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The guests at Harborview Hotel are a peculiar bunch. It won’t be easy to tell what’s simply a harmless quirk and what’s a sign of something sinister. The demon is watching, so observe carefully. Failure could be fatal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.poster.avif?t=1775132044\" width=672 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.webm?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/6d77632b292dc2efe4a86b078b272a3d.mp4?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Judgment</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make is judged. The demon holds a trial after each one, and all you can do is wait, hoping your judgment isn’t your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.poster.avif?t=1775132044\" width=672 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.webm?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/extras/7c53dff2c39c221e1706153c0a40599e.mp4?t=1775132044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Peephole is a linear psychological horror game that offers a good 60-120 minutes of unique immersive experience inspired by Papers, Please.</p>", "short_description": "One room. One hole. One judgement. Watch the guests through your peephole, inspect their documents, dial the telephone, and judge who's normal and who's not. Do your job properly to avoid the demon's punishment.", "supported_languages": "English, Arabic", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/37b2d2f6d6c4c8b804e45984ea7f14156c228814/header.jpg?t=1775132044", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/5bf3694f92e51bbe1ede2fdc231811ef0372ed8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775132044", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033430/5bf3694f92e51bbe1ede2fdc231811ef0372ed8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775132044", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I7-9750H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Speakers (Realtek(R) Audio)\t</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12650H 2.30 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 laptop GPU 6GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Speakers (Realtek(R) Audio)</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Limeless"], "publishers": ["Limeless"], "demos": [{"appid": 4067270, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "U